":ref:`clip_scale_x_ref`, :guilabel:`Margine` e :guilabel:`Raggio Angolo` "
"key-frames."

#: ../clips.rst:317
msgid ":guilabel:`Reset Layout` — removes any layout keyframes."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Reimposta Layout` — rimuove tutti i fotogrammi chiave del layout."

#: ../clips.rst:318
msgid ""
":guilabel:`1/4 Size` — positions the clip at 1/4 of the screen in the "
"Center, Top Left, Top Right, Bottom Left, or Bottom Right corner."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`1/4 Dimensione` — posiziona il clip a 1/4 dello schermo al "
